I now have enough research to issue my verdict. Let me compile the findings.

**Research verified:**
- LHAW (arXiv:2602.10525): Confirmed real, Scale AI, four-dim taxonomy (GCIC), 285 variants from TheAgentCompany/SWE-Bench Pro/MCP-Atlas — NOT τ-bench
- UserRL (arXiv:2509.19736): Confirmed real; 8 gym environments, GRPO on τ-bench for tool use
- CLARITI (arXiv:2604.14624): Confirmed real; 8B clarification module on SWE via multi-stage GRPO, matches GPT-5 on resolution rate
- τ³-bench: Confirmed 27 airline + 26 retail corrected tasks
- EMNLP 2026 ARR: May 25 submission, August 2 commitment deadline — confirmed at emnlp.org
- AAAI 2027: February 16-23, 2027 Montreal; est. abstract ~July 25 / paper ~August 1 (matches proposal estimate; CFP not yet released)
- **New uncited papers found:** "Ask or Assume? Uncertainty-Aware Clarification-Seeking in Coding Agents" (arXiv:2603.26233, March 2026) and ClarEval (arXiv:2603.00187, Feb 2026) — both adjacent, not cited

